          "text": "8",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chihanalehi chanti, Yesu hakuya nakuhitahita nimunyikala yamaneni nimunyikala yanyanya, hakuyishimwina nikuyitwela nsaŋu yawanta waNzambi yayiwahi, hamu nekumi nayedi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "niambanda amakwawu okayi dehi ademoni, niyikatu; Mariya atenaŋawu nawu Mandaleni, mwafumini ademoni atanu nayedi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "niYowana iŋoda Chuza kalama kaHerodi, niSuzana, ni akwawu amavulu adiŋi nakumukalakela namahetawu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chikunapompi izaza dadeni, niantu amunyikala yamaneni ejima chanahwiluwu kudi yena, hakuyitila chishimu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nindi, Mukwakukuwa wayili nakukuwa mbutu yindi. Chakuwiliyi, yi kwawu yaholokeleli kunsa yanjila, hiyakuyidata nanyendu, hiyakuyidya kudi atujila ahaluzwizu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yi kwawu yaholokeleli helola, chiyinabaluki hohenohu yuma nikuuma, muloŋa yabulili meji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yi kwawu yaholokeleli munyiŋa, nyiŋa hiyikukulila hamu nambutu, hiyikuyijika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yi kwawu yaholokeleli hamaseki amawahi, hiyikukula hiyikusoŋa, yadiŋi ibaŋu dimu hiyikwikala nkulakaji. Chanahoshiyi yumiyi hakubidika nindi, Yowu wukweti matu akutiya atiyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atumbanji twindi hiyakumwihula mwaya chishimu ichi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yena hakuyila nindi, Enu anayiteji kwiluka nsaŋu jawanta waNzambi jajindawu, hakwila acheŋi akujitiyilaŋa muyishimu hohu; kulonda hela akumona, abuli kumona jiika, kutiya, akutiya kushinshikamu nehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi tiyenu mwaya chishimu ichi. Mbutu himaza aNzambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akunsa yanjila, wowu antu akwila chakuyitiyawu, diyabolu hakwinza nakuhukula mazu munyichima yawu, akenda kwitiya hiyakuhanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahelola, wowu antu akwila chakuyitiyawu, hiyakutambula mazu namuzaŋalu; wena muji nehi, akwitiya kapinji kanti, chakamonawu yuma yakuyeseka, hiyakusenukamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaholokeleli munyiŋa, wowu antu akwila chakutiyawu, hiyakudiyila kwawu; kwakama, nimaheta, nikutiya kuwaha nayuma yawumi wunu, hiyikuyijika, kusoŋa chalala nehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yahamaseki amawahi, wowu antu atiyaloŋa mazu namuchima wawu wawuwahi walumbuluka, hiyakuyikwata naŋovu, hiyakusoŋa nikutatakenamu chikupu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muntu habutulaŋa inoŋu adisweka mwibaŋu hela muchaliluku, wadishaŋa hamesa kulonda antu akwijila mwitala akamoni to-o. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa hikwekala chuma chabutaŋawu chikubula kumwekana hatookaku; hela chuma chakujinda chikubula kutiyakanaku, chikwidika hatooka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi babelenu chimukutiya; muloŋa muntu wukweti diyi akwinkawu; muntu wabula, akamutambula aka kanamoniyi nindi wudi naku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kudi yena hikukwinza mama yindi nawana kwindi, hiyakukaŋanya kushika kudi yena naluntu iwadiŋuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakumuleja nawu, Mama yeyi nawana kweyi anemani hanzi, anakukeŋi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakuyakula nindi, Mama yami nawana kwami wowawa akutiya mazu aNzambi hiyakwilamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wena mafuku owu, ifuku dimu hakwijila muwatu wumu, niyomweni niatumbanji twindi. Hakuyila nindi, Tuzambukenu kwishinadi dejiya; ashinjika niwatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chadiŋi nakwendawu yena aya ninamutulu; hejiya hihakukunka mpepela yasweja Ŋovu, watu hiwukuya nakwinzala meji, hivakukeŋa kufwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakwinza nakumuhindwisha nawu, Mwanta, Mwanta, tunafwi! Hakuhinduka, hakuhoshola mpepela nimeji adiŋi nakubwankaŋila, amwena nizo-o, kuwunda nibe-te-te. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakuyila nindi, Kukuhwelela kwenu kwokudihi? Atiya niwoma, hiyakudihayamina, hiyakudila wumu namukwawu nawu, Yeniwu akwovwahilawu kudi mpepela nimeji hinyi?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ashika nikwituŋa dawaGeraseni, domba mesu kuŋahliya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chanafumiyi muwatu, nindi akanduki kwisaŋa, hikukumubulakana iyala wudi nakufuma mumukalowu, wazakuka dehi ademoni; halekeliyi kuvwala mahina hela kushakama mwitala halena dehi chacheni, chiŋa kushakama kumajamu hohu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chanamumoniyi Yesu, hakukaluka, hakudinata kumesu indi, hakubidika naŋovu, nindi, Ni kweti nsaŋwinyi naneyi Yesu Mwana kaNzambi Mukwakubadika? Nalembi, bayi wunkabishaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa henohu wamwila dehi yenowu demoni wazonda nindi fumaku mudi muntu. Muloŋa wamukwatilaŋa kakavulu; wadiŋi muntu wakuhemba kudi akwawu hohu, wakukasa namaleŋi nituyanda twayikuŋu; chakukotolayi yena yumoyu, hiyakumupwapwila mumasaŋa kudi demoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu hakumwihula nindi, ijina deyi yeyinyi? Nindi, Yami Lejiyoni; muloŋa mudi yena mweŋila ademoni amavulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakumulembelela nawu, Bayi wutuhaŋila mwikelaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwenoku kwadiŋi izanvu dawaŋulu adiŋi nakudiila hampidi, hiyakumulembelela nawu ayiteji kwijila mudi aŋulu. Hakuyiteja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ademoni afuma nimudi muntu, eŋila nimudi aŋulu; izanvu dawaŋulu danduka nikwanduka, hidikuya mwakunkumuka nankashi, nimwijiya chu-u, afwa nimumeji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayidiishilaŋa chanachimonuwu, hiyakutemuka, hiyakuya nakuleja antu adiŋi mumukala nimwituŋaodu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakuya nawu atali chuma chinamwekani; chanenzuwu kudi Yesu, hiyakuwana owu muntu munafumi ademoni, nashakami dehi kunyendu yaYesu, navwali chachiwahi, maanindi anamufuntili dehi; atiya niwoma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Antu achimweni hiyakuleja akwawu chanamukoleshuwu owu wazakukilaŋa ademoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Antu adiŋi kumutamba wetuŋa dawaGeraseni ejima hiyakumwila nawu afumuku; muloŋa woma wunasweji dehi kuyikwata; yena hakwijila muwatu hakufunta cheŋi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Owu iyala munafumi ademoni, hakumulembelela nindi niyaloŋa neyi; ilaŋa yena hakumufuntisha, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nindi, Funtaku kwitala deyi wuleji akwenu yuma yanakwililiyi Nzambi kutoha. Hakuya nakutiyakesha mumukala wejima yuma yamwilililiyi Yesu kutoha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chafuntiliyi Yesu, izaza hidikumushikŋa chachiwahi, muloŋa wejima wawu adiŋi nakumutalila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutala hikukwinza iyala ijina dindi Jayirusa, nyuli yashikola, hakudinatila kunyendu yaYesu, hakumulembelela nindi ayi kwitala dindi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "muloŋa wadiŋi namwanindi wamumbanda wumu hohu, wanyaka kafwampi ikumi nayiyedi, hakukeŋa kufwa. Hadiŋi nakuyayi, mazaza awantu hiyakujika kudi yena mbe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.42"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumbanda wumu wapwekelaŋa mashi nyaka ikumi nayiyedi, wamanisha dehi yuma yindi yejima kudi ayimbuki, kutwesha kumúuka nehi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hakwinza kunyima yaYesu, hakukunka kumukundulu wehina dindi; hohenohu mashi indi apwekelaŋa oma nichau. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu hakwihula nindi, Anankunki kudinyi? Chadikaliluwu antu ejima, Petulu nawakwawu adiŋuwu nawu hiyakwiia nawu, Mwanta, mazaza enda akushinjeka nikukuhumahuma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu hakwila nindi, Hadi muntu nankunki; muloŋa neluka mudami munafumi Ŋovu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Owu mumbanda, chanamoniyi nakaŋanyi dehi kuswamana, hakwinza nakuzaala, hakudinata hamaseki kumesu indi, hakushimuna hatooka kumesu awantu ejima nsaŋu yamukunkililiyi, ninichi chanakoliyi dehi hohenohu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu hakumwila nindi, Mwanami, kukuhwelela kweyi kunakukoleshi dehi; yaloŋa nakuwunda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.48"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iku wuchidi kuhosha, kwitala danyuli hikukufuma muntu hakumuleja nindi, Mwaneyi nafwi dehi; bayi wumukabisha Nkuluŋaŋaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu chanachitiyiyi, hakumwakula nindi, Bayi wutiya womaku; kuminaku dakukuhwelela hohu, wukukola kwindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chanashikiyi kwitala, hetejeli kwipilamu namuntu wacheŋuku, chiŋa aPetulu naYowanu naYakoba, nitata yamwana namama yindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adiŋi nakumudila nikutumpa kudi antu ejima; yena hakuyila nindi, Bayi mudilaku; hanafuku, wudi namutulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakumuseha chakumudiwula, muloŋa amumweni nafwi chikupu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.53"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
